            <name>
                <baseName xml:lang="en">Ventilation system, average for appartment buildings, steel ducts, without GHE</baseName>
            </name>
            <classificationInformation>
                <common:classification>
                    <common:class level="0" classId="ff1072e5-b2a6-348e-9ddd-e14d1129df3f">ventilation</common:class>
                    <common:class level="1" classId="5d55f898-d647-3403-84b7-e0ce92fb56a9">ventilation systems</common:class>
                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Production of a ventilation system for an appartment building with a specific air flow rate of 0.92 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. The reference value of the inventory is 1 m2 heated gross floor area. The inventory is based on a study of an appartment building with 6 flats, a heated gross floor area of 780 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 720 m3/h. The inventory includes an average of decentral and central systems. It includes average components for air handling units, ducts (including 30mm thermal insulation where needed), air valves, roof-hoods, dampers and silencers. No insuation for fire protection or fire dampers included. The data represent a ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel and includes compact air handling units with cross plate heat excangers as heat recovery and a nominal air flow rate of 200-1200 m3/h per unit. No ground heat exchanger, ventilation of side rooms, cellars or car parks are included.;
UUID: 1c1d1081-ccdf-3c67-b178-12e0e282da4c</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
